  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nIf a face-up Fusion, Synchro, and/or Xyz Monster(s)
    you control is destroyed by battle or an opponent's card effect while this card
    is in the Pendulum Zone: You can add 1 Pendulum Monster with the same original
    Type as 1 of those monsters, from your Deck to your face-up Extra Deck. You can
    only use this effect of \"Pendulum Witch\" once per turn.\n\n[ Monster Effect
    ] \nIf this card is Normal or Pendulum Summoned: You can target 1 card in your
    Pendulum Zone; destroy both that target and this card, and if you do, add 1 Level
    4 or lower Pendulum Monster from your Deck to your hand. You can only use this
    effect of \"Pendulum Witch\" once per turn. If this card in the Monster Zone
    is destroyed: You can place this card in your Pendulum Zone."
